1513 0 obj
  << /ActualText (INNOVASIVE\nElectronic Document Management Portal \050Antigravity\051\nBuilt an enterprise EDMS with complex approval workflows\054 digital signatures\054 and QR verification\056 Developed the core frontend using Vite React 19 and Tailwind v4\054 including a custom Lexical text editor\054 AI document summarization\054 and interactive Recharts dashboards\056\n\nProvident Fund Management Application \050Antigravity\051\nDeveloped using Vite React 19\054 TypeScript\054 and Tailwind CSS v4\056 Built a multi\055step onboarding flow for fund membership and an interactive risk assessment module that adapts UI themes based on user results\056 Implemented complex form handling for member profiles\054 beneficiaries\054 and investment plans using Formik and Valtio\056 Integrated PDPA consent and registration APIs via TanStack Query and managed application routing with Wouter\056\n\nEnterprise Lab Management Application\nI developed an\240enterprise management system\240using\240Next\056js\054\240TypeScript\054 and\240Tailwind CSS\056 I built the core modules for inventory tracking\054 user management\054 and laboratory workflows\056 I also implemented state management using\240MobX\054 integrated digital signature features\054 handled complex form data with\240Formik\054 and managed API synchronization through\240TanStack Query\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 1514 0 R
     /Pg 1487 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

