  << /ActualText (OOKBEE Career Website \046 Recruitment Platform \046 Workshops\n\042Gained hands\055on experience as a Full\055Stack Intern\054 building websites from front\055end to back\055end using React\054 Next\056js\054 NestJS\054 and Node\056js \050JavaScript\057TypeScript\051\056 Designed web interfaces using Tailwind CSS\054 Ant Design\054 and MUI\054 and managed databases like PostgreSQL and MongoDB\056 Closely mentored by senior developers through workshops and real\055world projects\054 I learned how to write clean code\054 structure project folders properly\054 and build standard REST APIs and CRUD systems\056 I also gained practical experience in checking application performance and following best practices\054 like naming conventions\054 to make the code easy to read and maintain\056\042)
     /K [ 19 ]
     /P 1526 0 R
     /Pg 1487 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
